  "content": "# 弓附魔扩展\n\n**本数据包与模组**扩展了弓的附魔功能，现在弓可以附加抢夺附魔，并且允许同一把弓同时拥有经验修补和无限附魔。同时，一把斧头也能混合搭配不同类型的武器附魔。\n\n**‎◾示例：**\n\n![弓附魔扩展](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7b2ce08eae725f5cd4acd51bdf5287aa6b98484a.jpeg)\n\n![弓附魔扩展](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/592ad7fa98a58eb7dbfc046e12af481d117bcbe9.jpeg)\n\n## 详情📝\n\n- **弓附魔扩展** **兼容** **1.21 至 1.21.11** 版本\n- **弓附魔扩展**为附魔台新增了 **（扩展）** 选项🌐\n- **弓附魔扩展** 与任何 **附魔数据包** 兼容\n- **无需** **解压**下载的文件🗂️\n\n## 更多项目：\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-armor-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TM5K3dNM/ezgif-com-speed-43.gif\" alt=\"装备附魔扩展\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/expanded-weapon-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bML9W70B/ezgif-com-speed-44.gif\" alt=\"武器附魔扩展\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-trident-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VcwSJqRJ/Expanded-Trident-Enchants-Logo.jpg\" alt=\"三叉戟附魔扩展\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-mace-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXv2pS15/Expanded-Mace-Enchants-Logo-2.jpg\" alt=\"狼牙棒附魔扩展\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-axe-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Fqxsn0qL/ezgif-com-speed-47.gif\" alt=\"斧头附魔扩展\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-bow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWLkm7bC/ezgif-com-speed-48.gif\" alt=\"弓附魔扩展\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-crossbow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PzT0xXgD/ezgif-com-speed-49.gif\" alt=\"弩附魔扩展\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-spear-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTJBJp9c/ezgif-com-resize-1.gif\" alt=\"长矛附魔扩展\"></a>",
